💡 4. What happens under the hood
When you hit that endpoint:

TaskSchedulingController.testInsights() calls
TaskSchedulingService.insightsNightlyCron().

That method:

Checks timezone offsets whose local time ≈ 02:10 AM.

For each offset bucket:

Calls _stepThreeDays() → aggregates entries for each user.

Calls _stepWeekly() → aggregates 3-day segments into weekly.

Calls _stepMonthly() → aggregates weekly into monthly.

Each aggregation writes into your aggregated_insight table using
the AggregatedInsightsService.upsertThreeDays() and upsertRollup() methods.

